            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Baking Nana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband really doesn't care for zucchini or ground turkey but he liked these. He said they weren't over the top great but he did eat it all. The patties tried to crack and fall apart on the grill, so pan frying might have been a better method. Served on a whole wheat bun &amp; a side of coleslaw."
