            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amanda Evrard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I found these to be pretty tasty - but I upped the healthy factor by subbing old fashioned oats for the bread crumbs. My only complaint is they were pretty crumbly and some of them ended up more as meat chunks than burger patties.",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-19T11:17:45.140Z"
