            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "just_jam"
            },
            "reviewBody": "these were pretty tasty.. i cut this in half and omitted the bread crumbs and egg white.. i used 1 T of dried onion flake for the fresh and dried parsley for the fresh as well.. i tripled the salt.. added 1/2 tsp of italian seasoning and red pepper flakes.. i think i could have used a little more zucchini or maybe some shredded carrot.. either way it was good.. ty for the recipe",
            "datePublished": "2015-05-29T18:51:07.710Z"
          },
          {
