            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JLO"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Oh my goodness! I am so happy I tried this recipe. You think \" turkey burgers \" dry, bland- NOT these turkey burgers! They were moist and tasty and noone had to feel guilty about eating a burger! My husband, his aunt muself and our 2 children (ages 2&amp;4) ate the heck out of these burgers and loved it so much we decided that next time I must make much more and freeze them. Thank you for turning something boring into something totally delectable! Mmmmmmmmmm!",
            "datePublished": "2015-03-16T19:48:38.677Z"
          },
